WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:04.030
(spirited music)

00:00:08.261 --> 00:00:11.360
- We are currently in the
train from Munich to Vallendar

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.466
to attend the forum WHU,

00:00:13.466 --> 00:00:17.310
a student-run conference
on business matters.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.500
So I thought I'd do this
a bit in the vlog style.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.950
You can follow me around

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.510
and see what we are doing here together

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:24.630
as (indistinct) students of this really,

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:27.530
probably the best private
business school in Germany.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.410
I will share a couple of my insights

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:31.043
of what my student time was like,

00:00:31.043 --> 00:00:32.600
what I would recommend you

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.370
to make the best out of your
time in business school.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.270
So follow me for the day, very
much looking forward to it.

00:00:40.769 --> 00:00:43.519
(spirited music)

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.820
We got just picked up in Koblenz

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:50.827
by the team from forum WHU,

00:00:50.827 --> 00:00:53.580
and we're on our way to the conference.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:55.410
I'd argue two of the big advantages

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.290
of studying at a school like WHU.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.650
Is that first, you really are in a network

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:01.750
of highly motivated, highly capable,

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.130
other business students as well.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.710
This will very likely
help you then later on,

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:09.200
and second, you will also have
lots of access to companies

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.524
who go to the career
fairs, present themselves.

00:01:11.524 --> 00:01:14.380
This will enable you to
network with the recruiters,

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:15.270
surely a big help.

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:16.290
Of course, to some extent,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:19.420
this is also the case at public
universities like in Munich,

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.901
but certainly less so.

00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:23.520
Though, of course, what
I also enjoyed in Munich

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:26.510
that for instance, I did also
second bachelor in philosophy.

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:28.200
So you have the opportunity to also look

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.654
into other subject areas, degree areas,

00:01:30.654 --> 00:01:32.850
(indistinct), of course,
at a business school,

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:35.860
typically you're more
limited to this one subject

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.832
that you are studying there.

00:01:37.832 --> 00:01:40.582
(spirited music)

00:01:44.697 --> 00:01:47.447
(spirited music)

