for the workshop of today,

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:29.438
which I will talk about
professional communication

00:02:29.438 --> 00:02:31.455
here at WHU in Vallendar.

00:02:31.455 --> 00:02:34.205
(spirited music)

00:02:38.369 --> 00:02:41.510
(upbeat spirited music)

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:44.310
I do occasionally do lectures
for students like this.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:45.950
Besides here at WHU,

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:48.450
I'm also a lecturer at the
University of St. Gallen

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:49.970
