00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:43.820
That was for me, very interesting

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.590
to see that such a person

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.490
would be at WHU.

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:48.720
- Just for the uninitiated,

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.890
Gorillas, at the moment,

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:53.500
probably the fastest-growing
startup in Germany,

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.680
