00:04:58.050 --> 00:04:59.840
So a pretty insane story indeed.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:02.700
But I like what you just
said, the memorable moment.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:04.630
Maybe also to hear from the others.

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:07.930
What was your memorable
moment, most memorable moments

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:11.176
