accepted into the school.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:20.910
I mean, WHU, or as we call it, vey-hah-oo,

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.305
has very, very high prestige

00:05:22.305 --> 00:05:24.827
and naturally it's a great thing

00:05:24.827 --> 00:05:28.030
to be admitted in this school
and to be part of the program.

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:28.863
And so for me,

00:05:28.863 --> 00:05:31.697
finding out I was actually
going to be part of it

00:05:31.697 --> 00:05:33.683
was just the non plus ultra, as we say.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:35.893
- Yeah, for me,

00:05:35.893 --> 00:05:36.726
it was also the first weeks

00:05:36.726 --> 00:05:40.530
