introduced to our classmates,

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:41.950
and the Career Center,

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:46.040
which I think is very good and
helpful to start our careers

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.436
and get connections to companies,

00:05:48.436 --> 00:05:52.373
and yeah, other CEOs of great
businesses and industry.

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:54.750
- To just pick this exactly up.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.570
I mean, this is for
sure one of the reasons

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:58.440
why people like to go to
business school like that

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.267
because of course they hope

00:06:00.267 --> 00:06:01.785
that it will benefit their career.

00:06:01.785 --> 00:06:03.090
I mean, obviously.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:06.030
What does this mean at WHU,
at university like this?

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:09.050
So how does such an university
like here in Vallendar,

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.400
