00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.496
How does the team help you
to get into the career track

00:06:13.496 --> 00:06:16.393
into your dream employers
that you want to do?

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.533
- Maybe I could pick up on that.

00:06:19.533 --> 00:06:21.315
And then I guess one of
the most important factors

00:06:21.315 --> 00:06:22.406
