at our cover letters

00:06:38.135 --> 00:06:39.970
and basically making sure

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:42.720
that the students have the
best possible opportunities,

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:43.860
that they're out there,

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:46.190
and to really push
themselves in the direction

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:47.990
that they have to go, or want to go.

00:06:49.255 --> 00:06:51.210
- Maybe another very interesting thing

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.120
