00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:56.140
So they invite all these
big companies, right?

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.177
McKinsey, Bain, they
come on campus, right?

00:06:58.177 --> 00:07:00.280
You talk with the consultants.

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:02.140
